{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警方表示，本周二至四接獲4宗報案，指有圖書館及傳媒機構收到一封可疑信件，信內載有白色粉末。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警員接報到場，經爆炸品處理課人員檢查後，相信該些粉末沒有爆炸危險，人員檢走有關粉末作進一步檢驗。經初步調查，案件暫列作「發現可疑物品」。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:31.940372+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:04:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:39:21.265241+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:34:13.686629+00:00","content_hash":"4325973b0a115c574ffd256965937f96d8c12ff3b0767d884dc64f2ce862ebe0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}